        "original_id": "d9b5fe02-d544-5718-82c4-ac89bd2ae0dc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Davis, Guillermo del Toro, Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, Thomas Tull, Matthew Robbins, Burn Gorman\n- Films: Pacific Rim, Crimson Peak, The Dark Knight Rises\n- Television Series: Torchwood, Game of Thrones\n- Roles: Dr. Owen Harper, Karl Tanner, Phillip Stryver, Dr. Hermann Gottlieb, Major Edmund Hewlett, Mr. Holly\n\nFacts:\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Owen Harper in the BBC series \"Torchwood\" from 2006 to 2008.\n- Burn Gorman played Phillip Stryver in the 2012 film \"The Dark Knight Rises\".\n- Burn Gorman played Karl Tanner in the HBO series \"Game of Thrones\" from 2013 to 2014.\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Hermann Gottlieb in the 2013 film \"Pacific Rim\".\n- Guy Davis is best known for collaborations with director Guillermo del Toro, including the films \"Pacific Rim\" and \"Crimson Peak\".\n- Burn Gorman played Major Edmund Hewlett in an AMC series in 2014.\n- \"Crimson Peak\" is a 2015 American gothic romance film directed, co-produced, and co-written by Guillermo del Toro.\n- \"Crimson Peak\" was co-produced by Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, and Thomas Tull.\n- \"Crimson Peak\" was co-written by Matthew Robbins.\n- Burn Gorman played Mr. Holly in the 2015 film \"Crimson Peak\".",
